  "notes": "返佣规则与欠额更清楚。\n\n- 邀请返利页说明佣金仅按在线实付部分计算，余额支付不计佣，退款后追回对应佣金。\n- 会员返利卡和入口正确显示账号专属返佣比例，明确档位按有效邀请消费金额计算。\n- 钱包、邀请页、会员卡和提现页将负佣金显示为「佣金欠额」，并说明后续佣金优先抵扣欠额；欠额说明支持窄屏和大字号换行。\n",
  "notesEn": "Clearer commissions and outstanding debt.\n\n- The referral page explains that only online payments earn commission. Balance payments are excluded, and refunds reverse the associated commission.\n- Referral cards and shortcuts show your account's effective rebate rate, including personal rates, and explain that tiers depend on eligible referred spending.\n- The wallet, referral page, member card and withdrawal page show negative commission as outstanding debt. The repayment explanation wraps on narrow screens and with larger text.\n",
